      "sourceTextSha256": "2e67b672f3d74fe5a60f11ed5c72c2ccfb48d62a59124d09e0f6fc8542ef67b7",
      "text": "After breakfast, transfer to the airport for your flight to the Atacama Desert, one of the best places on Earth for stargazing thanks to its altitude, dry climate and minimal light pollution. Visit the Valley of the Moon near San Pedro de Atacama, with its lunar-like rock formations, salt caves and towering dunes glowing in the colours of the setting sun, and enjoy a stargazing session through powerful telescopes, observing galaxies, nebulae and planets.",
